                            <comment id="17865880" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2024 06:15:48 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CALCITE-5430&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CALCITE-5430&lt;/a&gt;. The issue has been solved in calcite, but kylin uses the old version. Therefore, at present, treating the `ifnull` as a udf from spark, register this function to kylin udf. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CALCITE-5708&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CALCITE-5708&lt;/a&gt;. This issue solved this problem, but kylin uses the old version. At present, we cherry-pick some code to workaround. This issue will be handled in the later issue of upgrading calcite 1.30 thoroughly.&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
